BT 1 0 0 1 0 103.8 Tm -0.108305 Tw 11.2 TL /F1 8.2 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (Traditional counting statistics \(runs, strike rates, economy rates\) fail to capture true clutch ability because they treat all game states identically. A) Tj T* 0 Tw (boundary in Over 19 of a decided game contributes to a player's strike rate but adds zero win probability. Our objective is to formulate an) Tj T* (objective, pre-delivery state-space model that quantifies pressure without outcome contamination, adjusts for venue and phase expectations,) Tj T* (regularizes small-sample noise via Bayesian shrinkage, and generates actionable franchise rankings.) Tj  T* /F2 8.2 Tf (Core Analytical Objectives for Rajasthan Royals:) Tj /F1 8.2 Tf  T* (\177 Formulate objective, leak-free match pressure strictly on pre-delivery state s_t.) Tj  T* (\177 Establish context-adjusted performance models decomposing run scoring and wicket value.) Tj  T* (\177 Enable fair, unbiased comparisons across Powerplay, Middle, and Death overs.) Tj  T* (\177 Regularize small-sample anomalies via Hierarchical Empirical Bayes shrinkage.) Tj  T* (\177 Deliver actionable recruitment targets categorized by franchise feasibility.) Tj T* ET
